<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro is made to switch throughout your loadout very fast and efficient. This can be used if you are bored. You can also delete some of the numbers if you don't want the macro to go to that slot. Hope with macro can help you. Enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 10 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 33 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 33 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 34 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 34 1
Delay 5 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>